**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pgdata
**/.env
**/.env.*
backend/static
frontend/dist
docs/
.git
.github
*.md
# The MCP skill (SKILL.md + references/*.md) must ship in the image. `*.md` above only
# matches root-level files (Docker patterns are anchored at the context root), but
# re-include explicitly so a future `**/*.md` can't silently drop it. Last match wins,
# so keep this after any .md exclusion.
!backend/app/mcp/skills/**
